# Chemistry (src/experiments/molecules) — self-contained wheel, depends only on
# numpy + Pillow, both already pinned above. Installed with --no-deps so it cannot
# move torch.
#
# PINNED, and the pin is load-bearing. RDKit decides canonical SMILES, the
# stereo-free partition key and the Murcko scaffold split, and *none* of those
# enter `MoleculeAdapterConfig.build_version` — a silent minor bump can therefore
# move roles and canonical strings under a cached build with nothing in the run
# record to show it. 2026.03.5 is the version every build to date was made with,
# including `42f7a14bed21f876`. Moving it is a deliberate act that revalidates
# the partition, not something a recompile does on its own.
rdkit==2026.3.5
